#EXTM3U
# Aurora TV's demo playlist, for App Review and the store screenshots.
#
# Every stream here is a public test stream its owner publishes for players to test
# with, or an open film under Creative Commons. No broadcaster's channel and no
# copyrighted artwork, so it is safe to show in screenshots and to hand to App Review.
# Check each one still plays before a submission: test streams do move.
#
# Add it in Aurora with: Settings > Providers > Add another provider > paste
#   https://raw.githubusercontent.com/noahklimczuk/iptv-player/main/apple/AppStore/review-playlist.m3u
